---
title: Cherry Cookies
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Cookies
cook time: 10-15 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@flour{2%cups}
@egg{1}
@baking soda{0.5%tsp}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@salt{1%tsp}
@milk{2%Tbsp}
@brown sugar{1%cup}
@chopped pecans{0.5%cup}
@shortening{0.75%cup}
@cherries{0.5%cup}
@coconut{0.5%cup}

Drop cookies onto cookie sheet and bake at 375 degrees for 10-15 minutes.
